<template><main><div class="sub" style="margin-top:0">输入研究序列号进入对应研究；没有序列号也可以直接选择下方数据库。</div><section class="entry-card"><div class="entry-title">研究序列号</div><div class="entry-note">已有研究序列号时，可快速定位并进入对应研究项目。</div><div class="input-row"><input v-model.trim="serial" placeholder="请输入研究序列号" @keyup.enter="enter"><button class="enter" @click="enter">进入</button></div></section><section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div class="section-title">数据库快捷入口</div><div class="section-note">选择研究类型</div></div><div class="platform-list"><button class="platform" @click="router.push('/patients')"><span class="picon">◇</span><span class="pbody"><span class="pname">纤维肌痛研究数据平台</span><span class="pdesc">Fibromyalgia Research Database</span></span><span class="chev">›</span></button></div></section></main><div v-if="toast" class="toast show">{{toast}}</div></template>
<script setup>import{ref}from'vue';import{useRouter}from'vue-router';const router=useRouter(),serial=ref(''),toast=ref('');function enter(){toast.value=serial.value?`研究序列号 ${serial.value} 的接口待接入`:'请输入研究序列号';setTimeout(()=>toast.value='',1600)}</script>
